        <mxCell id="n2" value="sequence = head + 1 (or 1)&lt;br&gt;previousHash = head.recordHash (or 64 zeros)&lt;br&gt;recordedAt clamped: never before head.recordedAt" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="450" y="485" width="270" height="60" as="geometry" />
